的麥香紅茶可以喝。\n\n出餐效率高，店員態度親切，還會主動詢問是否需要加麵。家裡小朋友非常喜歡，一下就全部吃光，是會想讓人多次回訪的好店。\n\n菜單很簡單：\n醬油豚骨拉麵 $135（內用免費加麵）\n麻辣豚骨拉麵 $145（內用免費加麵）",null,[0,39]]]],[],[null,null,13136,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21JMGVXSTFiVVl3WkhGUU56Vkphbmh3ZFRoNVNuYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xb6e80856cc70d14a!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmI0eWI1bUYwZHFQNzVJanhwdTh5Snc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21JMGVXSTFiVVl3WkhGUU56Vkphbmh3ZFRoNVNuYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21JMGVXSTFiVVl3WkhGUU56Vkphbmh3ZFRoNVNuYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21JMGVXSTFiVVl3WkhGUU56Vkphbmh3ZFRoNVNuYxILMGRYMXRhSzQ2aGEaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09tSTBlV0kxYlVZd1pIRlFOelZKYW5od2RUaDVTbmMSCzBkWDF0YUs0NmhhIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARStFwzFYI6LYqCzBkWDF0YUs0Nmhh\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwidmrnAzNKWAxXIfvUHHeqxDEoQoykIygEoEQ"],null,[null,[[1,1]]]],"0ahUKEwid-b7AzNKWAxXzdV4EHVMLK-8Q0pMFCHYoBg"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwidmrnAzNKWAxXIfvUHHeqxDEoQ0pMFCKsBKAY"],[["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tnMlkzbzNibEJUVGt4SmNXdHJabGhhVVVacmVsRRAB",["0x0:0xb6e80856cc70d14a",null,1782465783939304,1782465800531722,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103718822030672618546/reviews?hl\u003dzh-TW"],null,null,["郭奉孝","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU5MKrVvfSGDRRDi4c2BIopOZH9eBjG9Rjnp09mUNIjGgfAZ3U\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100",["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103718822030672618546?hl\u003dzh-TW"],"103718822030672618546",null,14,17,null,[1,6,1],2,["在地嚮導 · 14 則評論",null,null,null,null,[null,"0ahUKEwidmrnAzNKWAxXIfvUHHeqxDEoQpr8GCMwBKAA"]]]],null,"2 個月前",null,null,null,null,null,null,["Google","https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/product/1x/googleg_48dp.png",null,null,5],null,1],[[5],null,[["CIABIhCvT0MMvo1J69BP65ZImXCM",["CIABIhCvT0MMvo1J69BP65ZImXCM",10,12,null,null,null,["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmMXZLGJYv4rOyURVfAtKowtFtPuLLkIOvNchr1LC